# Repo-local Android SDK install (~3-5 GB), written by
# `make android-sdk-bootstrap`. Gitignored so each clone gets its
# own. Override the install location with ANDROID_SDK_ROOT in env
# if you'd rather use a system-wide one.
/.android-sdk/

# Gradle wrapper artifacts. Generated per-clone by
# `make android-bootstrap` (which runs `gradle wrapper`) rather
# than committed, matching the SDK-bootstrap pattern above. Keeps
# the wrapper jar's binary blob out of the repo and lets each
# clone pick its preferred system gradle.
/gradlew
/gradlew.bat
/gradle/wrapper/
